<title>UK: MSI leads $150 mln preference share issue.</title>
<headline>MSI leads $150 mln preference share issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following redeemable</p>
<p>cumulative preference share issue was announced by lead manager</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WING TAI HOLDING LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	DIVIDEND   1.50	MATURITY    =</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> IND PREM   15-18 PCT LISTING    LUX/SING  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> REDEMPTION 131.08    YIELD	50 BP OVER 5-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	3-YEAR NON-CALL, THEN AT ACCRETED VALUE OF 130 PCT</p>
<p>		$22.5 MLN GREENSHOE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
